  "description": "Classic hybrid styling with an eye towards value, the North Bay is perfect for recreational riders and commuters on a budget. Sporting a 21-speed Shimano drivetrain along with front and rear linear pull hand brakes, the North Bay handles flat and hilly conditions with ease. It's a great choice for your next pleasure ride or just getting around town.\nCustom formed high tensile steel frame\nShimano Tourney 21-speed drivetrain with MegaRange gearing\nShimano Revo twist shifters\nAlloy linear-pull front and rear brakes\nAlloy crankset with sealed cartridge bottom bracket\nAlloy quick release wheels with stainless steel spokes\n700 x 38c hybrid tires\nUpright steel handlebar and alloy stem\nSun comfort saddle and ergo grips\nPlastic chainring guard\nAlloy kickstand",
